        <mxCell id="poolNote" value="Per-sandbox hardening:&#10;• read-only FS, no persistent volume&#10;• no clipboard, no upload/download, no print&#10;• outbound 443 only (egress allowlist)&#10;• Chromium kiosk: no URL bar, devtools disabled" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1">
